tasks.description:
创建 Note 数据库模型用于存储笔记信息。在 app/models/ 目录下创建 note.py 文件，定义字段: id (唯一标识), title (笔记标题), content (笔记内容), created_at (创建时间), updated_at (更新时间)。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

创建笔记的增删改查 API 路由。在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 文件，定义以下接口: 创建笔记 (POST /notes), 获取所有笔记 (GET /notes), 更新笔记 (PUT /notes/{id}), 删除笔记 (DELETE /notes/{id})。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

设计和实现笔记管理的前端页面。在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 文件，包含以下功能: 显示笔记列表 (通过 GET /notes 获取数据), 创建新笔记 (通过 POST /notes 提交表单), 编辑笔记 (通过 PUT /notes/{id} 更新数据), 删除笔记 (通过 DELETE /notes/{id} 删除数据)。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

为笔记添加组织功能。在 app/models/note.py 中添加 category 字段 (笔记分类)。更新 API 路由 (app/routes/notes.py) 支持按分类筛选笔记 (GET /notes?category=)。更新前端页面 (templates/notes.html) 支持按分类显示笔记。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str, category: str}) -> {id, title, content, category, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, category, created_at, updated_at}]
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str, category: str}) -> {id, title, content, category, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
